<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Circuit City begun at hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Circuit City begun at hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities said its analyst Tom Courtney has started coverage of Circuit City Stores Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- In a written statement, Courtney said with PC demand slowing he believes the consumer electronics superstores will struggle to maintain market share against direct marketers and computer superstores.</p>
</text>
